	(text "AGND meets GND at one point; GND meets BUS- at one point next to the port shunts\n(controller ground = BUS-). Layout: gate-drive primaries decoupled to GND locally."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 413.24 296.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5f5c9a81-c03a-5134-b3d5-27ab21ec79de")
	)
	(text "Both boards live: GND = AGND = BUS-. Supplies +24V / +5V / +3V3 go TO the control board. Commands are 3.3 V\nlogic after the control board's trip latch; every command input is pulled low here (open = off)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 119.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "807827ea-9593-581b-b1be-d260e26af1a9")
	)
	(text "NSI6651 inputs are specified at VCC1 = 5 V only (VINH <= 3.5 V, p7) and the SN6505B EN needs 0.7 VCC: one\nSN74AHCT1G08 (VIH 2.0 V) per line. Each PWM is ANDed with EN here as well, so a low EN removes every\ncommand within 8 ns, ahead of the drivers' RST/EN filter (0.48-0.8 us)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 231.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9bf05989-b06e-5b3a-a188-265de4f1d514")
	)
	(text "PORT STATUS TO PC: HOLD, MOV_OK, PORT OVER-CURRENT INTO FLT_N"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.136 243.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a875992a-595c-5b44-be49-0dc224a7b03d")
	)
	(text "COMMAND INPUTS: PULL-DOWNS AND 3.3 -> 5 V BUFFERS (GDRV.INPUT_BUFFERS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 132.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c6457199-376c-5d95-9b64-ae6a7f5a652d")
	)
	(text "HOLD = A_HOLD OR B_HOLD (|I_port| >= 0.97-1.03 kA, contactor held). MOV_OK high only while BOTH varistor\nmonitor loops conduct (each reads 'open' below ~200 V on its port). Port OC (|I| >= 387-413 A, lean_shunt)\npulls FLT_N low (open drain): the control board's latch trips without firmware (aR-fuse gap, port_spec).\nK_A / K_B / K_PRE pulled low: open = coil off (the hardware interlocks follow on the port sheets)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.136 307.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d57ae630-0c1e-564a-a3d8-5d4ecdeed797")
	)
	(text "RDY (WIRED-AND) AND FLT_N (WIRED-OR)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 243.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ef1fa5b9-ab89-5a22-992e-f10510b273af")
	)
	(text "RDY: every NSI6651 RDY (VCC1 and VCC2 UVLO), the +5V and +5V_GD supervisors and the aux status (live 24 V\nUV), pulled up HERE to +3V3 (4.99k). FLT_N: every NSI6651 /FLT + port OC; pull-up on the control board.\n+5V supervisor TPS3710 107k/10k: RDY low below 4.52-4.69 V (AHCT VCC >= 4.5 V, bias headroom)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 286.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f4755292-f0d2-5ef2-a3b3-cf3450c48a36")
	)
